            "review_title": "Review at La Mozza Dalat",
            "review_text": "Anh Hoang\n2 contributions\n0\nWorth experiencing in the Dome.\nJun 2026 • Family\nA very nice meal with the family at La Mozza in the middle of Da Lata, the dish is a little concerned from taste to presentation. Pizza and pasta are both delicious, fresh and Italian. What we liked most was the feeling of relaxation, sitting together and enjoying every moment. Friendly and attentive staff. I will definitely be back in the next time. ❤️\nValue\nService\nFood\nAtmosphere\nTranslated from Vietnamese\nShow original\nWritten June 27, 2026",
